{"unit_id":"uckkk__dsh-golden-ratio#card-zh","repo":"uckkk/dsh-golden-ratio","commit":"c63d6da3c59e7928d0effb68897978bac99d4e3f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"黄金比例计算器是面向 DSH 的尺寸比例计算工具，可在会话中调用注册的工具。它按黄金比例放大或缩小基准数值、把总长度拆成黄金比例两段，并根据矩形已知边求另一边；也提供白银比例的短边到长边换算。结果以数值和比例说明呈现，输入值须为正数。适合处理版面、字号、标志尺寸、页边距和构图的比例计算。工具由插件加载到 DSH 工具接口，无需 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:13-28","lib/index.js:31-49","lib/index.js:51-88"]}
{"unit_id":"uckkk__dsh-golden-ratio#card-en","repo":"uckkk/dsh-golden-ratio","commit":"c63d6da3c59e7928d0effb68897978bac99d4e3f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Golden-ratio calculator for DSH sessions. Tools scale a value, split a length by the golden ratio, calculate a golden rectangle side, and find a silver-ratio long side. Useful for layout, type, and logo sizing. Positive numeric inputs only; no API key or external service.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:13-28","lib/index.js:31-49","lib/index.js:51-88"]}
